11.1 EXCEPT FOR THE EXPRESS WARRANTY IN SECTION 10 AND ANY WARRANTY THAT CANNOT LAWFULLY BE EXCLUDED, THE LICENSED PRODUCT, DOCUMENTATION, SUPPORT, AND DELIVERABLES ARE PROVIDED “AS IS” AND “AS AVAILABLE”, WITH ALL FAULTS.

